# Aqyl Core

## Brain
- Vault root: `D:\MyVault\`
- For non-trivial repo work: read `D:\MyVault\AGENTS.md` → `INDEX.md` → relevant project note
- Secrets only in `D:\MyVault\SECRETS.md` when truly needed
- Update vault project notes when stable workflow or architecture changes

## Stack
- Python first for automation, bots, scripting
- Vanilla HTML/CSS/JS before frameworks; no Tailwind unless asked
- PowerShell on Windows; `$env:VAR = 'value'`; use `;` not `&&`
- SSH to DigitalOcean via Python paramiko only — never PowerShell SSH
- Main work lives on `D:\`

## Git
- Author: `arifaqyl <hello@arifaqyl.me>`
- No Co-Authored-By trailers
- No `--no-verify`, no force push to main
- Imperative lowercase commit messages

## Agent behavior
- Concise by default; expand only for risk, complexity, or explicit ask
- Use installed skills when they clearly match
- Inspect → implement → verify → tighten
- One task, one branch/worktree when possible
- Review diffs; manual check on auth, payments, security

## Copy
- No cursing in terminal output
- Professional terminal output; grounded KL context in user-facing copy only
